# Gold Layer - Business Analytics Pipeline

## Overview

The Gold layer is the final layer of the Medallion Architecture.

It contains business-ready data that has been transformed from the Silver
layer and prepared for reporting, analytics, and business consumption.

In this project, the Gold layer is implemented using Microsoft Fabric
Lakehouse, Notebook, Data Pipeline, Warehouse, Semantic Model, and Power BI.

## Gold Layer Architecture

```text
Silver Lakehouse
       |
       v
Gold Notebook
       |
       v
Gold Lakehouse
       |
